{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-2","storyName":"寂静长廊的两端","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在若麦的梦境中，若麦放弃了当鼓手，转而进入龙门的演艺圈。每天辛苦磨练演技，赶赴各种商业活动的她似乎并不快乐。原本好不容易空出来的休息时间，又被与空合作的综艺填满。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["迷途的少女","？？？","导演","祐天寺若麦","编剧","助理","电话里的声音","电视里的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>数千数万双眼睛之下，如人偶一般，动弹不得。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>去到他们要求我去往之处，发出他们期望我发出之声。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我，毋畏爱意。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","duration":"0.7","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"已经两天两夜没有见到人烟了……","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"龙门……龙门究竟在哪里？家在哪里？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"爸爸，妈妈……我好渴……好累……","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"远处的……是高楼吗？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"快要到了……还不能睡……","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":35},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷途的少女","text":"……","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"咔！","id":41},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_65_g7_filmandtvstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":46,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"太精彩了，若麦小姐！我心里所想的，完全就是这个感觉！","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"平凡的乡村少女决然抛下所有，踏上了追寻音乐梦想的旅程。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"这场戏拍的就是她的至暗时刻，从此以后，她便会遇到赏识自己的贵人，成为龙门最受欢迎的乐手。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"谢谢导演夸奖~","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"在看这个剧本的时候，我意外地很能理解女主角的心境。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"那当然！这个剧本、这个角色就是为若麦小姐你量身定制的啊！","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"*尚蜀方言*明明是为了抢新年档期，临时修改的剧本……","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"嗯……？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"投资方眼红《少女鼓手》大卖，指定由你来主演我们这部电影。","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"然后你的经纪公司要求电影必须在新年档上映，导演逼着我一周内改完剧本……","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"原本的结局……应该是少女在弥留之际，做了一个似真似幻的梦。","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"在一片眩光中，资质平平的少女晃晃悠悠地走上了领奖台。","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"平凡的少女在梦里赢得了所有人的认可，也终于和一切达成了和解。","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"这才是这个片子应该有的具有讽刺意味的结局啊！","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"*龙门粗口*，你那破本子，要是没若麦小姐的加持，能拿到这种级别的资源？","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"谁稀罕你的那些资源？我看你就是捧投资方捧惯了，忘记了自己的艺术追求！","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"现实里哪有那么美好的事情，普通人怎么可能有机会走到万众瞩目的台前？！","id":69},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"*尚蜀方言*你不是乡下出身，当然不会懂啊！但我是，我懂啊！","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"臭码字的，看我怎么收拾你——","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","delay":"0.4","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.7","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":78},{"type":"text","text":"言语的交锋之间，两人的距离越来越近，口舌之争最终演变成了拳脚角力。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"你们有话好好说……","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","text":"","id":84},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"编剧","text":"你拍的那些破镜头，我早*尚蜀粗口*就想吐槽了！","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"导演","text":"你等着，等这次我飞黄腾达，*龙门粗口*第一个就把你踢了！","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"0.6","id":90},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"哈？不是——！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":97},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"c","fadetime":"1","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":101},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_bg_deluxeroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":108,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理","text":"医院那边来消息了，编剧和导演被分到同一个病房，两个人正好对床。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理","text":"不过好在都上了护颈，现在两个人只能互相干瞪眼。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理","text":"麻烦的是，这戏短时间内应该是拍不了了……","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"反正最近都没有好好休息过，现在这样说不定还正好~","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理","text":"等后续的拍摄计划确定后我会再联系你，这段时间要麻烦你先维持随时待命的状态了。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":120},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"（小声）唉，不知道为什么，总感觉轻松一点了……","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"不行不行，还不能放松下来——","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"n","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","volume":"0.8","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"妈妈……？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":134},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"3","channel":"nw","id":135},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_trnpndor","volume":"0.7","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_rooftop_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"少女拿起电话，推开滑门，走到了阳台上。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"*方言*若麦，吃过晚饭了没？最近忙不忙呀？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"*方言*吃过啦。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"*方言*最近家里的麦子又丰收了，我们每天一大早就要出门，得忙到太阳落山才能做完。","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"*方言*唉，不是早就说过了吗？你们就好好在乡下享福吧。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"n","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"*方言*这不是怕你太累嘛，要是太累的话，回家休息一下也无妨呀。","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"*方言*对了，今年过节你想吃什么？我和你爸提前准备一下……","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"*方言*过节不可能回得来啦！大家最轻松的时候，就是我最忙的时候……","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4","focus":"n","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"*方言*这样吗……","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"（微弱的声音）妈妈，姐姐终于接电话啦？","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.3","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"（渐近的跑步声）","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"姐姐！我们有看到电视上你新电影的预告片哦！","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"可惜我们这边没有电影院，不然就去买票支持你了！","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"嘿嘿，没关系啦。等之后出了影碟，我给你们寄一份回去。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"n","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"好——！","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"姐姐，你在电影里打鼓的样子真的好帅啊！","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"我最近也开始练架子鼓了，用的就是你以前那套旧的鼓。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"你现在架子鼓是不是打得越来越厉害啦？我也想有一天能像你一样在舞台上演出呢！","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我……嘿嘿，最近有点忙，没有时间练习啦。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"不过我也不会落下练习的，我们得一起加油才行！","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"好的！妈妈喊我们去睡觉啦，姐姐也要早点休息哦！","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"大家注意身体哦！晚安！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"晚安！","id":177},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phonestop","volume":"1","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","volume":"0.8","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ringoff","volume":"1","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"若麦小姐，刚刚公司来了临时通知，有一个大型综艺节目想邀请你去参加。","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"时间是明晚的八点开始，预计会录制到第二天的凌晨。这个时间可以吗？","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"这也太突然了……","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$3","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"原因是……他们请的另一位嘉宾，是演艺偶像空小姐。","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"对方和我们的人气旗鼓相当，并且空小姐在圈内圈外的评价都很不错。","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"这是个很好的曝光机会，机会难得，虽然时间上有点紧张，但公司还是推荐你去参加一下……","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"那你回复说——若麦希望能跟大家合作愉快。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"好的。那么今天的工作全部结束了。","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电话里的声音","text":"晚安，若麦小姐。祝你好梦。","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"（……至少今天终于能睡个好觉了。）","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-2$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phonestop","volume":"1","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw1","id":208},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"3","channel":"nw1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_trnclsdor","volume":"0.7","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":213},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_bg_deluxeroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","delay":"1.2","id":218},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"她抬头看向茶几上的电子钟，上面的时间是“00:23”。","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"她重重地倒在了沙发上，身子很快陷了进去，她被牢牢地包裹住。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"有几个月没练鼓了……？","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"若麦拖着步子走到电子架子鼓前，镲片上已经蒙了一层薄薄的灰尘。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"……我的鼓棒去哪了？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"上一次拿起鼓棒的情形，也有些记不起来了。","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"是在家里？还是更早以前在《少女鼓手》的片场？","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"……算了，看会电视再睡吧。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"slide1","id":237},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"slide1","id":238},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"粉丝朋友们好呀，我是新人演员若麦！","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"我最新主演的电影《少女鼓手》正在上映！这是一部特别有趣的电影，大家一定要去电影院观看哦！","id":244},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_result","volume":"0.5","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"我的梦想是成为龙门第一——不，泰拉第一的鼓手！","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$4","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"……","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"和若麦一起，成为最想成为的自己吧~","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"……","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我是专业人士，有些东西总是要舍弃掉的……没错。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"image","id":261}],"characters":["迷途的少女","？？？","导演","祐天寺若麦","编剧","助理","电话里的声音","电视里的声音"]}